ProCiv Madeira Home Assistant integration

Weather warning data is provided by IPMA (Instituto Português do Mar e da
Atmosfera), https://www.ipma.pt.

The icons in this folder (icon.png, icon@2x.png) are rendered by
scripts/render_brand.py of https://github.com/utek/prociv_madeira from the
"weather-cloudy-alert" icon of Material Design Icons by Pictogrammers
(https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of the licence is in LICENSE-2.0.txt.
The icon colour and cropping were changed.
